      "title": "Build an extension",
      "content": "<!-- docspress:{\"version\":1,\"key\":\"docs/extensions/build-an-extension\",\"source\":\"examples/contextual-sidebars/docs/extensions/build-an-extension.md\",\"hash\":\"15ffc360f6609e14e2e78a0f82670c747355836e60671e314f6a27aa3a147285\",\"sourceContentBase64\":\"\",\"sidebarPosition\":10,\"sidebarId\":\"extensions\",\"sidebarRoot\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Create an extension package, register its entry point, and test it against a development store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use the <a href=\"/docs/apis/rest-api/\">REST API</a> when the extension needs remote data.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
