      "title": "Quickstart",
      "content": "<!-- docspress:{\"version\":1,\"key\":\"docs/guides/quickstart\",\"source\":\"examples/contextual-sidebars/docs/guides/quickstart.md\",\"hash\":\"8e43e2c3f178715012e5dfd40799306d1fed5f541dc37594af86ee56df2e24f8\",\"sourceContentBase64\":\"LS0tCnRpdGxlOiBRdWlja3N0YXJ0CnNpZGViYXJfcG9zaXRpb246IDEwCi0tLQoKSW5zdGFsbCB0aGUgQWNtZSBTREssIGNyZWF0ZSBhIGNsaWVudCwgYW5kIG1ha2UgeW91ciBmaXJzdCByZXF1ZXN0LgoKQ29udGludWUgdG8gdGhlIFtSRVNUIEFQSSByZWZlcmVuY2VdKC4uL2FwaXMvcmVzdC1hcGkubWQpIHdoZW4geW91IG5lZWQgZW5kcG9pbnQgZGV0YWlscy4K\",\"sidebarPosition\":10,\"sidebarId\":\"docs\",\"sidebarRoot\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Install the Acme SDK, create a client, and make your first request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Continue to the <a href=\"/docs/apis/rest-api/\">REST API reference</a> when you need endpoint details.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
